  "body": "Offering breathtaking sea views, generous proportions, and endless flexibility, this home presents a rare opportunity to secure a property with outstanding potential in an incredible coastal location.\r\n\r\nSpread across multiple levels, the home comprises four bedrooms and three bathrooms including a fabulous master suite featuring a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, and sweeping sea views. Multiple living areas and a versatile layout that can easily accommodate families, extended family living, guests, or those seeking work-from-home flexibility.\r\n\r\nLock up and leave style living whilst boasting a spacious family room which opens onto a sun-drenched terrace, perfectly positioned to take in the spectacular outlook. The main living area, kitchen, and dining space flow out to another spacious deck with absolutely panoramic views of the sea and Rangitoto.\r\n\r\nThe layout offers flexibility, creating an ideal setup for multi-generational living, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nComfortable as it stands today, the home offers an exciting opportunity to renovate, modernise, and add significant value over time. The combination of a spacious home, a multi-purpose floor plan, spectacular sea views, and a tightly held location makes this a truly rare find.\r\n\r\nProperties with this much space, flexibility, and potential in such a sought-after location seldom come to market. Bring your vision and unlock the full potential of this exceptional coastal opportunity.",
